          {% render 'card-review', name: 'Emily Rodriguez', rating: 5, text: 'Love the rush shipping option! Got my patches in time for the event. Top-notch quality!' %}
          {% render 'card-review', name: 'Andrew Thompson', rating: 5, text: 'The attention to detail is phenomenal. Our company logo patches look exactly like the digital proof!' %}
          {% render 'card-review', name: 'Patricia Garcia', rating: 5, text: 'Third time ordering and always impressed. The velcro backing is super strong and holds up great.' %}
          {% render 'card-review', name: 'Kevin O_Brien', rating: 5, text: 'Fast turnaround and excellent customer support. They helped me perfect my design before production.' %}
          {% render 'card-review', name: 'Michelle Lee', rating: 5, text: 'These patches are perfect for our scout troop. Durable, colorful, and reasonably priced!' %}
          {% render 'card-review', name: 'Brandon Davis', rating: 5, text: 'Ordered custom patches for my motorcycle club. Everyone loves them! Will be back for more.' %}
          {% render 'card-review', name: 'Amanda Wilson', rating: 5, text: 'The heat-press application was so easy. Patches look professionally sewn on!' %}
          {% render 'card-review', name: 'Christopher Martinez', rating: 5, text: 'Bulk order discount saved us a ton. Quality remained excellent across all 500 patches.' %}
          {% render 'card-review', name: 'Nicole Taylor', rating: 5, text: 'My small business logo patches turned out beautifully. Customers always ask where I got them!' %}
          {% render 'card-review', name: 'Ryan Anderson', rating: 5, text: 'The 3D puff embroidery option makes our patches stand out. Absolutely love the texture!' %}
